---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Rule from "../components/Rule.astro";
import Sources from "../components/Sources.astro";
import o from "../data/omis.json";
import Plates from "../components/Plates.astro";
import Lightbox from "../components/Lightbox.astro";
---
<Base title="The Omiš Line" eyebrow="Seventeen generations published · 1318–1948"
      dek="A family chart for the Dalmatian branch, running from an envoy of Pope Urban V to the middle of the twentieth century. Three of its people were already in this archive under other sources, and they match."
>
<section class="blk">
  <h2>{o.story.heading}</h2>
  <p class="dek" style="margin-top:8px">{o.story.lead}</p>
  <div style="margin-top:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
    {o.story.rows.map(r => (
      <div class="one" style={r.key ? "border-left-color:var(--accent)" : ""}>
        <div class="lab">{r.lab}</div>
        <p style="margin-top:8px" set:html={r.text.replace(/\*\*(.+?)\*\*/g,"<strong>$1</strong>").replace(/(^|[^*])\*([^*\n]+?)\*/g,"$1<em>$2</em>")}></p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p class="cap" style="margin-top:16px">{o.story.source_story}</p>
</section>

<Rule name="pomegranate" label="The branch itself" />

<section class="blk">
  <h2>{o.photos.heading}</h2>
  <p class="dek" style="margin-top:8px">{o.photos.lead}</p>
  <div style="margin-top:24px"><Plates ids={o.photos.ids} /></div>
</section>
<Lightbox />

<Rule name="arrows" label="The chart" />

<section class="blk">
  <div class="note">{o.caveat}</div>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:26px">
    <p>The chart is titled <em>Rodoslovno stablo obitelji Franceschi</em>. Read from the bottom it starts at Zadar — a notary, a municipal archivist, an officer of the port salt-house — moves to Omiš with an admiral, and then holds there as <em>posjednici</em>, landholders, for three hundred years.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<Rule name="arrows" />

<section class="blk">
  <h2>The direct line</h2>
  <div class="scroll" style="margin-top:22px">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Generation</th><th class="m">Dates</th><th>What the chart records</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>{o.line.map(([n,d,w],i)=>(
        <tr><td><span class="mono" style="color:var(--ink-3);margin-right:9px">{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>{n}</td>
        <td class="m">{d}</td><td>{w}</td></tr>))}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>
<Rule name="pomegranate" />

<section class="blk">
  <h2>Where it meets the rest of this archive</h2>
  <p class="dek">Six points where the chart and independently-found records touch. This is the test of a family tree: whether it survives contact with sources it was not drawn from.</p>
  <div class="stack" style="margin-top:26px">
    {o.matches.map(([n,t])=>(
      <div class="qrow">
        <div><h3 class="qq">{n}</h3></div>
        <div><p class="qw">{t}</p></div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
<Rule name="helm" />

<section class="blk">
  <h2>The wider family on the chart</h2>
  <div class="scroll" style="margin-top:20px">
    <table><tbody>{o.siblings.map(([y,t])=>(
      <tr><td class="m" style="width:110px">{y}</td><td>{t}</td></tr>))}</tbody></table>
  </div>
  <div class="note" style="margin-top:26px">{o.omittedNote}</div>
  <p class="cap">{o.source}</p>
</section>
<Rule name="arrows" label="Almissa, 1840" />

<section class="blk">
  <h2>{o.gazzetta1840.heading}</h2>
  <p class="dek" style="margin-top:8px">{o.gazzetta1840.lead}</p>
  <div style="margin-top:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
    {o.gazzetta1840.rows.map(r => (
      <div class="one" style={r.key ? "border-left-color:var(--accent)" : ""}>
        <div class="lab">{r.lab}</div>
        <p style="margin-top:8px;white-space:pre-line" set:html={r.text.replace(/\*\*(.+?)\*\*/g,"<strong>$1</strong>")}></p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p class="cap" style="margin-top:16px">{o.gazzetta1840.source_gdz}</p>
</section>

  <Sources ids={["plemstvo", "omisphotos", "familysearch", "gazzetta-zara-1840"]} />
</Base>
